  "description": "A scene depicting a meme with Robert De Niro standing in front of a backdrop with logos, overlaid with text that contains racist and hateful content. The text sarcastically questions whether Black people, who were present during slavery, should also be removed from historical symbols. The scene is designed to provoke outrage and reinforce racist narratives by falsely equating the presence of Black people with the need to remove symbols of oppression, which is a direct attack on Black identity and history.",
